@startuml 哪吒网络安全SIEM GUI数据流
!theme mars
title 哪吒网络安全 SIEM — GUI 数据流

participant "SIEM 核心线程" as Core
participant "Logger" as Log
participant "GuiSink" as Sink
queue "Qt Event Queue" as Queue
participant "LogModel" as Model
participant "QSortFilterProxy" as Proxy
participant "LogDelegate" as Delegate
participant "QTableView" as View
participant "show_log_detail" as Detail

Core -> Log : log(level, message)
Log -> Sink : write(level, line, len)
note over Sink : 解析日志行\n提取时间戳+级别+消息
Sink -> Queue : invokeMethod\nQt::QueuedConnection
Queue -> Model : append(timestamp, level, message)
Model -> Model : 环形缓冲区 5000条\nbeginInsertRows/endInsertRows
Model -> Proxy : dataChanged 信号
Proxy -> Delegate : data() 调用
Delegate -> View : paint() 绘制行\n着色严重度徽章

用户 -> View : 点击行
View -> Detail : show_log_detail(idx)
Detail -> Detail : 立即显示:\n- 时间/级别/内容\n- Hex Dump\n- IP 内网/回环
Detail -> Queue : QtConcurrent::run
Queue -> Detail : GeoIP::lookup + ResolveHostname
note over Detail : 异步回填:\n国家/城市/坐标/ISP/主机名
@enduml
